    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, the Vanguard Chrono is getting a ton of hits on the site right now. Thinking about how to push sales. Should we go with a scarcity pricing model or maybe add one of those \"only 2 left in stock\" countdown timers to get people to checkout faster?",
